OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrests after woman, 18,
OL,4,Adies following crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested after
OL,7,Fan 18-year-old woman died following a
OL,8,Fcrash, police have said.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said the crash
OL,11,Finvolving a white Mercedes and a white
OL,12,FVolkswagen Polo happened on Bloxham
OL,13,FRoad, close to the junction of
OL,14,FSpringfield Avenue in Banbury,
OL,15,FOxfordshire, at about 21:20 BST on
OL,16,FSaturday.
OL,18,FThe driver of the Volkswagen Polo was
OL,19,Ftaken to hospital where she later died.
OL,20,FHer family was being supported by
OL,21,Fspecially trained offices, said the
OL,22,Fforce.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
